			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize core submodules for API modularization and dependency updates\n\nUpdate ten core submodules to finalize the decomposition of monolithic window namespace factories, refactor UI bridge architecture, and apply upstream dependency patches.\n\n- **Cocoon**: Decompose `Window/Namespace.ts` into distinct factory modules (`CreateOutputChannel`, `CreateStatusBarItem`, `CreateTerminal`, `CreateWebviewPanel`) to enforce separation of concerns and PascalCase hierarchy. Implements full lifecycle management for extension host API surfaces including lazy `processId` resolution and React mount safeguards for `WebviewView`.\n- **Sky**: Refactor `Bridge.ts` into domain-specific installers (`InstallCommands`, `InstallSimpleRelays`) using dynamic imports to reduce static dependency graphs and improve tree-shaking. Activates dormant Mountain-to-Sky event channels for tree views and configuration changes.\n- **Dependabot Patches**: Update `pnpm/action-setup` to v6.0.5 in `Output` and `Sky`, `astro` to v6.2.2, `zod` to v4.4.3, and `@xterm/xterm` to v6.1.0-beta.216 in `Sky`.\n- **Merge**: Sync `Common`, `Echo`, `Mountain`, `Rest`, `Wind`, and `Worker` to their latest `Current` branch states.\n\nThese changes restore the architectural pattern of dedicated factory modules, enable finer-grained unit testing for UI proxies, and ensure the editor leverages the latest security and performance fixes from upstream dependencies.",
